    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino Space Station</strong> is a 2D pixel art platformer. <strong>Restore power. Evade dinosaurs. Escape the wreckage.</strong> A meteor shower has wrecked a station full of resurrected dinosaurs. Navigate dark, perilous corridors, dodge raptors, and survive. Warning: Gameplay maybe anxiety-inducing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate in the Dark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/f80444f6a617cdba71678b8421ac0d9a.poster.avif?t=1755166138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/f80444f6a617cdba71678b8421ac0d9a.webm?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/f80444f6a617cdba71678b8421ac0d9a.mp4?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade Hostile Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/aef1f8893661dc6d0e52daae976cb372.poster.avif?t=1755166138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/aef1f8893661dc6d0e52daae976cb372.webm?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/aef1f8893661dc6d0e52daae976cb372.mp4?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/cea785f9e14657e667b62cf56bee1073.poster.avif?t=1755166138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/cea785f9e14657e667b62cf56bee1073.webm?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/cea785f9e14657e667b62cf56bee1073.mp4?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/0abe24b573d0ebde4fa40e011247966a.poster.avif?t=1755166138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/0abe24b573d0ebde4fa40e011247966a.webm?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/0abe24b573d0ebde4fa40e011247966a.mp4?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 stages with powered off/powered on cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated Dinosaurs - Compsognathus, Pachycephalosaurus, Velociraptor, Oviraptor, Pterodactyl, Dilophosaurus and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay value options such as stage speed run times and finding hidden collectables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad optimised gameplay.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino Space Station</strong> is a 2D pixel art platformer. <strong>Restore power. Evade dinosaurs. Escape the wreckage.</strong> A meteor shower has wrecked a station full of resurrected dinosaurs. Navigate dark, perilous corridors, dodge raptors, and survive. Warning: Gameplay maybe anxiety-inducing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate in the Dark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/f80444f6a617cdba71678b8421ac0d9a.poster.avif?t=1755166138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/f80444f6a617cdba71678b8421ac0d9a.webm?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/f80444f6a617cdba71678b8421ac0d9a.mp4?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade Hostile Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/aef1f8893661dc6d0e52daae976cb372.poster.avif?t=1755166138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/aef1f8893661dc6d0e52daae976cb372.webm?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/aef1f8893661dc6d0e52daae976cb372.mp4?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/cea785f9e14657e667b62cf56bee1073.poster.avif?t=1755166138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/cea785f9e14657e667b62cf56bee1073.webm?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/cea785f9e14657e667b62cf56bee1073.mp4?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/0abe24b573d0ebde4fa40e011247966a.poster.avif?t=1755166138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/0abe24b573d0ebde4fa40e011247966a.webm?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406740/extras/0abe24b573d0ebde4fa40e011247966a.mp4?t=1755166138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 stages with powered off/powered on cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated Dinosaurs - Compsognathus, Pachycephalosaurus, Velociraptor, Oviraptor, Pterodactyl, Dilophosaurus and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay value options such as stage speed run times and finding hidden collectables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad optimised gameplay.</p></li></ul>",
